     "kind": "capability"
    }
   ],
   "assumptions": [
    "Boundary: clerical duties; providing directions to visitors (task 4544) is a sibling task.",
    "Coverage: s1 keeps 70 because many callers still ask for a person; s2 keeps 40 for mail without a reference; s4 keeps 30 for changes outside the form's rules. The customer's form time is shown in s3.",
    "The means prior puts 79% in person; the steps show 24%, because calls and mail are counted under mail and phone (45%), a different convention from the in-person prior."
   ],
